  "id": "axon-reflex",
  "term": "axon reflex",
  "definition": "An axon reflex is a nerve-mediated local response in which activation of small nerve fibres in the skin produces a nearby widening of blood vessels, seen as a flare after heating. In this context, it is used as an indicator of small fibre function.",
